@----------------------------------------
@node EXPRESSIONS
@prev FUNCDEFS
@next LETTERSDIGITS
@toc INDEX
@{h1}Expressions are parsed using a precedence-climbing algorithm

The production below is schematic.

<expr>       ::= "(" <expr> ")" 
               | <factor> { <op> <factor> }

<factor>     ::= <number>
               | <string>
               | <call_expr>
               | ( "*" | "&" ) <var> [ "[" <expr> "]" ]

<var>        ::= <ident>

Operators available (similar to C, ++/-- can be prefix or postfix)

<op>         ::= "+" | "-" | "*" | "/" | "%" 
               | "==" | "!=" | "<" | ">" | "<=" | ">=" 
               | "&&" | "||" | "^" | "|" | "&" | "<<" | ">>"
               | "++" | "--"

@{h2}Identifiers, letters, and digits

<ident>      ::= <letter> { <letter> | <digit> | "_" }
